WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.570
Telo Ride now has a home on the web, and every push is checked before it gets there.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:16.163
One App Service runs the API, and the API serves the app. One site, one origin, so

00:00:16.163 --> 00:00:18.741
the session cookie is same-site.

00:00:20.647 --> 00:00:25.594
Open any route directly and the app answers, never cached stale, with the security

00:00:25.594 --> 00:00:27.101
headers riders need.

00:00:30.971 --> 00:00:36.780
Addresses under API, hubs and health stay the backend's. Without a session, a 401,

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:38.072
never the app.

00:00:41.295 --> 00:00:46.358
On every push, three jobs run side by side: lint, the production builds, and the

00:00:46.358 --> 00:00:48.304
critical acceptance paths.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:56.866
The first run, on cold caches, went green in one minute twenty-four, well inside the

00:00:56.866 --> 00:00:58.290
five-minute limit.

00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:06.962
One critical path per feature: two Playwright specs and five backend cases. Unit

00:01:06.962 --> 00:01:09.646
tests stay on the developer's machine.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:17.688
On main, the deploy publishes the API with the app inside, migrates the database,

00:01:17.688 --> 00:01:19.327
and only then ships.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:27.770
Riders get the same app, served by its own backend, on a phone, a tablet, a laptop

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:28.891
or a desktop.

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:37.773
What the tests prove: twenty-six backend tests, eight of them on hosting, and twelve

00:01:37.773 --> 00:01:39.635
behaviour specs, all green.

00:01:43.237 --> 00:01:47.840
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:48.185 --> 00:01:52.697
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:52.697 --> 00:01:54.368
every hill and interval.

00:01:54.713 --> 00:01:59.891
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:59.891 --> 00:02:05.339
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:02:05.339 --> 00:02:08.329
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:02:08.675 --> 00:02:11.167
A custom workout lives under Profile.
